== Effects ==
* 50% chance of adding an extra blind item in {{r|Treasure Room}}s.
** When one of the items is taken, the other disappears.
** The extra blind items in {{s|Downpour}}, {{s|Dross}}, {{s|Mines}}, {{s|Ashpit}}, {{s|Mausoleum}}, and {{s|Gehenna}} (and {{s|Corpse}} if {{t|Bloody Crown}} is held) have a 50% chance to be revealed instead.

== Notes ==
* The effect includes instances where pedestal items would be replaced with something else, such as the [[Pica Run]] challenge. If there is not a blind equivalent, both items will simply be shown.
* Its effect can work on the same floor it was picked up on if the Treasure Room hasn't been entered yet.
* Works in both Treasure Rooms in {{mode|greed}} Greed mode.

== Synergies ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}}: The chance to add a blind item in Treasure rooms is now 100%. The chance to reveal the blind item in the alt path Treasure rooms is now 100%.
* {{i|Damocles}}: An additional visible item will be generated from the blind item.
* {{t|Devil's Crown}}: Both items can be taken, but still need to be paid for, and one will remain blind if not on the alt path.

== Interactions ==
* {{t|Golden Horse Shoe}}: The second item will always be blind if not on the alt path.
** This doesn't apply to {{i|More Options}}.

